いします。\n服装は2人とも一糸纏わぬ全裸姿で、表情は少年は嬉しそうな感じで、おねえさんは優しい笑顔で楽しそうな表情です。\nまたおねえさんの身長は177cmの長身でお願いします。\nよければよろしくお願いします。\n\n金髪のおねえさん：https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_ER4wxVIAMS8Fv?format=png&name=900x900、https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_ER9RAVIAQG19J?format=png&name=900x900\n\n抱っこの参照例：https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/80932260", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@watermaskc1000/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dd75d921/uploads/origins/e9d41c1f-504a-4bdb-b5a6-dc691b8bf191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34175da497e050e4678abc9ead390f05", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dd75d921/uploads/origins/e9d41c1f-504a-4bdb-b5a6-dc691b8bf191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34175da497e050e4678abc9ead390f05, https://si.imgix.net/dd75d921/uploads/origins/e9d41c1f-504a-4bdb-b5a6-dc691b8bf191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d19cf588ee232677a978b7735ee9f84b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dd75d921/uploads/origins/e9d41c1f-504a-4bdb-b5a6-dc691b8bf191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=065fe8c621df3558815a38ad87df4ad3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "アピールありがとうございます\n\n自キャラをおねがいします\n胸は大きめで服がきつくてぽろりしちゃう感じでお願いします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/b7cJrl9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@watermaskc1000/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f5a3bb93/uploads/origins/c2e5ad85-8996-4220-ae7e-0d30b26c899d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa8b09fd66bf4320108da5a6146f8f31", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f5a3bb93/uploads/origins/c2e5ad85-8996-4220-ae7e-0d30b26c899d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa8b09fd66bf4320108da5a6146f8f31, https://si.imgix.net/f5a3bb93/uploads/origins/c2e5ad85-8996-4220-ae7e-0d30b26c899d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f